  "details": "If you are a regular windows user, you have windows security formely known as defender, if you then have done all the recommended steps, you have ransomware protection turned on, and this will block vrchat from saving pictures in the photo's folder, and that means all those awsome pictures will be lost forever without you knowing. \n\nso to prevent this from happening, \nif you are reading this vrchat team, we could just have a red pop up box in the bottom of the camera that says something like \"failed to save\" or something along those lines.\n\nKind regards\n\n~Marsy",
